      "source_audio": "",
      "text": ", the new initiate from the outside. My name's Jerry, I'm your# new roommate. I'm an initiate too! I've been studying so hard. Are you# an Initiate Knight or Scribe?",
      "source_text": ", the new initiate from the outside. My name's Jerry, I'm your\n# new roommate. I'm an initiate too! I've been studying so hard. Are you\n# an Initiate Knight or Scribe?",
      "source_line_start": 8,
